// Schedule A. First Amendment: the buy-out price loses its ten percent reduction.
#require "5-withdrawal.charter".
#require "7-amendment.charter".
Extend Fact amendment Identified by FirstAmendment
Amend first-amendment Actor company
  Repeals buy-out
  Installs {
    Power buy-out Actor company Recipient person
      Holds when True
      Valid when Held(withdrawing(person)) For 90
      Creates buyout-due(company, person, MulDivRound(book-value.usd,
                  Sum(Foreach capital: capital.int When capital.person == person), total-capital.int, Floor))
            , capital(person, 0)
      Terminates member(person), withdrawing(person)
  }
  Holds when True
  Valid when amendment-three-quarters(FirstAmendment)

Clause A.1 Approved "241d292482d9885a04bea7126d24928beae53498a1a095f80e2c7fa264511815"
  Norm "Clause 5.2 is amended to read: When the notice period ends, the company buys the withdrawing member's interest. The price is the member's percentage interest in the book value of the company." => first-amendment
.
